00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:35.830
Hey, robber girl!

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:38.920
I know who you are.

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:43.430
You'll see all those Borka robbers scatter with one blow.

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:48.340
The boy called Birk, who Ronja met at Hell's Gap,

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:51.260
was a child of Borka's robbers.

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:57.730
He said that Borka's robbers had moved into the north side of the Mattis castle.

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:00.820
When Mattis heard that...

00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:08.110
Robber Stare Down

00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:08.110
Robber Stare Down

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:29.360
Hey, you! Wake up. Tjegge!

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:34.830
Is my relief here already?

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:35.990
Huh?

00:03:35.990 --> 00:03:38.210
Why are you sleeping?!

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:41.040
I told you to stay awake!

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:43.420
I'm not sleeping.

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:46.420
I was just lying down and closing my eyes.

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.840
That's what "sleep" is!

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:51.220
I told you I'm not sleeping, okay?

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:52.510
Dammit! Don't lie!

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:53.290
Hey!

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:55.300
Someone's over there!

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:12.650
Boss!

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:17.740
It's an emergency!

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:20.080
Borka is waiting for you!

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:23.040
He's says he wants to talk to you immediately.

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:36.970
You'll clean up after yourself, right?

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:41.980
So, Borka wants to talk to me?!

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:43.690
Sure, why not?

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:46.650
If that's what he wants, then I'll give him hell!

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:50.030
And after that he won't be doing much talking for quite a long time!

00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:53.820
Even though I have no doubt he'll manage to recover!

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:00.330
What's going on so early in the morning?

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:02.290
What happened?

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:07.590
Hurry, you guys! Swallow your porridge as if the place were on fire!

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:16.340
We're about to take a wild bull by the horns, and throw him into Hell's Gap!

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:51.920
Getting old is vexing, isn't it?

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:58.340
Even if something exciting happens, I wouldn't be able to join in.

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:04.230
To begin with, there are too many steps in this castle.

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:57.330
I see, is that what Borka's robbers look like?

00:06:58.240 --> 00:06:59.980
They look really weak.

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:17.090
Borka?

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:35.550
You thieving dog!

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:37.250
Hmph!

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:43.820
I'm glad, Mattis...

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:47.200
That you came so uncommonly fast.

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:50.000
I would have come before,

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:53.920
but there was something I had to finish first.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:56.250
A poem I was writing,

00:07:56.250 --> 00:08:00.680
"Lament for a Dead Borka Robber," it's called.

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:05.850
If all you guys fell into Hell's Gap, and Undis became a widow,

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:10.270
she might be able to get a bit of comfort from it.

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:21.240
That's hilarious!

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:24.620
But do you think Undis would even recite such a poem?

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:29.410
Yeah Borka's wife doesn't have very refined taste, does she?

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:32.120
You hoodlums!

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:37.210
See? I told you this would happen!

00:08:37.210 --> 00:08:42.090
A civil conversation with them was impossible from the start!

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:44.510
It seems so.

00:08:48.310 --> 00:08:49.810
Hey, Mattis!

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:57.400
If you have the time to worry about us,
you should think more about comforting Lovis.

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:58.990
Huh?

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:07.070
She's the one who has to put up with you and your big mouth all the time!

00:09:19.090 --> 00:09:22.380
It looks as if they could both get on quite well, without any comfort, doesn't it?

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:33.270
Now, you listen to me, Mattis.

00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:38.650
There was no staying in Borka's wood any longer.

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:42.570
The Magistrate's soldiers are swarming there like flies.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:50.120
I had to take my wife, my child, and all my robbers somewhere.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:54.440
But just stealing yourself a place to live without asking,

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:56.960
is something no one with a sense of shame would do!

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:04.170
Strange talk from a robber.

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:09.760
Haven't you always taken what you liked, without asking?

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:10.810
Eh?

00:10:12.680 --> 00:10:15.430
Taken without asking?

00:10:36.790 --> 00:10:39.460
A-Anyways, that doesn't matter.

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:44.420
By the way, how did you guys even get into the castle?

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:47.220
How will knowing that help you at this point?

00:10:47.930 --> 00:10:50.010
It's obvious.

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:54.060
I'll throw you out the same way you came in.

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:04.820
And how do you plan on doing that, eh?

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:05.440
Huh?

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:08.530
How we got in, you said?

00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:11.120
I have this son.

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:21.540
The great successor of Borka's robbers, Birk Borkason.

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:17.510
You guys, let's go!

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:18.730
Yeah!

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:32.320
That's how we got here.

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:43.830
Don't say such lies!

00:12:43.830 --> 00:12:46.630
I'm positive there is no entrance on the north side!

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:51.780
There's not much you know or remember about this fortress, despite living here all your life.

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:56.640
In the first place, have you forgotten all about the past?

00:12:56.870 --> 00:12:58.390
Huh?

00:12:58.680 --> 00:13:02.140
Where the old pigsty used to be when you were a child?

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:03.690
The pigsty?

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:17.810
In those days, I had scarcely realized that we belonged to different clans, you and I.

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:19.790
Same here.

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:24.330
So I invited you to my castle and we were getting along well with each other.

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:53.030
Hey, it went in that direction.

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:54.860
There!

00:13:58.740 --> 00:14:00.200
You're in the way, move!

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:01.040
Move!

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:02.910
Where it is?

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:04.370
That way!

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:12.380
F-Father.

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:54.510
After that, my ears were boxed so hard I thought my skull was going to burst.

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:59.010
My father didn't forgive the Borka robbers, those cunning foxes.

00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:01.550
He crushed them whenever he came across them.

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:04.600
Yes, indeed. He was very quick to do such a good thing!

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:09.480
Thanks to the heavy beating I received that time, I finally understood.

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:13.800
Every member of the Mattis clan is my enemy, no matter what!

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:17.070
And that hasn't changed to this day!

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:19.740
Then I'll give you two options!

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:26.620
You can either lament for a dead Borka robber,

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:30.830
or you and your rabble will leave my castle the way you came!

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.250
Choose one!

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:37.760
No, I choose neither.

00:15:38.340 --> 00:15:41.760
I've made a home in Borka's keep now.

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:48.730
I'm staying here! I refuse to go anywhere else!

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:53.230
You guys!

00:15:53.230 --> 00:15:54.290
Right!

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:11.730
Don't tell me...

00:16:11.730 --> 00:16:14.630
You aren't going to fight them here, are you?

00:16:14.630 --> 00:16:16.210
What, is that a problem?

00:16:16.210 --> 00:16:18.630
Of course it's a problem!

00:16:18.630 --> 00:16:21.260
If you started a battle here...

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:23.930
...it would only end badly for all of us.

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:26.100
Then what should we do?

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:28.970
Retreat for today.

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:32.810
You'll find the right opportunity to fight in due time.

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:55.170
Listen! We'll end this for today.

00:16:55.170 --> 00:16:56.790
But don't forget!

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:59.590
You're an asinine wild bull!

00:17:00.340 --> 00:17:02.720
I'll grab your horns someday and...

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:05.800
I'll heave you into Hell's Gap!

00:17:06.430 --> 00:17:08.510
You should remember this, too.

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:14.230
If I am a wild bull, then I'll shove you into Hell's Gap with my sharp horns!

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:16.940
I'll be waiting for that day!

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:48.350
Ronja, the Robber's Daughter

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:48.350
Ronja, the Robber's Daughter

00:18:02.610 --> 00:18:04.150
Hey Father.

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:09.490
Father.

00:18:09.490 --> 00:18:12.040
What was that thing about taking without asking?

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:47.150
I suppose that wild bull, the one you are going to take by the horns

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:52.390
and heave into Hell's Gap, made a huge sound like "Kaboom!".

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:54.080
Eh?

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:56.790
Oh!

00:18:56.790 --> 00:19:01.920
That was a crash that rumbled all around the Mattis' castle, wasn't it?

00:19:03.920 --> 00:19:08.800
Eat your porridge, if you can chew it!

00:19:09.430 --> 00:19:12.390
And leave wild bulls to me!

00:19:12.390 --> 00:19:16.220
I'll deal with them when the time comes.

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:20.100
It's like it's in the ice!

00:21:59.550 --> 00:22:03.170
In this case, I'll have to run a lot so that I can warm up!

00:22:39.760 --> 00:22:41.850
Hey, robber's daughter!

00:23:01.910 --> 00:23:07.750
"First it was the castle, now I can't even find peace in the forest!"

00:23:08.250 --> 00:23:13.340
And with that thought, rage welled up inside Ronja.

